meeshop (0.8) unstable; urgency=low

  * New home page: OpenRepos "Recently updated" feed and a "Top rated" carousel
  * Developer pages: profile (avatar, name, signature) and the developer's apps
  * Threaded app comments shown as message bubbles with avatars
  * Installation queue with reordering and an installed-apps page
  * Screenshots now open in the built-in system image viewer instead of a browser
  * Network error dialog with Retry, plus assorted bug fixes and UI polish

